      "content": "Absolutely, framing the initial availability as a deliberate \"exclusive first-wave\" or a \"curated launch sequence\" is a strong strategic turn. This narrative intentionally shifts the focus from a supply failure to a high-demand, limited-release strategy dictated by *exclusivity*, not *inability to fulfill orders*. This tactic can actually enhance the perceived value and hype, provided the language is consistently elevated and aspirational.",
